26 noticetotheemployeeassoonaspossible,buthospitalityindustryemployeesmaynotbeterminated
27 forfailuretoworkashiftiftheshiftwasnotscheduledatleast7daysinadvance.
28 III. No employer shall retaliate against any employee because the employee has exercised,
29 ormayexercise,hisorherrightsunderthissection.
30 IV. The requirements of this section may be waived by the parties to a valid collective
31 bargainingagreement.

